{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20911","headline":"仁和里杂叙皇甫湜 · 李贺","name":"仁和里杂叙皇甫湜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大人乞马癯乃寒，宗人贷宅荒厥垣。\n横庭鼠径空土涩，出篱大枣垂朱残。\n安定美人截黄绶，脱落缨裾瞑朝酒。\n还家白笔未上头，使我清声落人後。\n枉辱称知犯君眼，排引才陞强絙断。\n洛风送马入长关，阖扇未开逢猰犬。\n那知坚都相草草，客枕幽单看春老。\n归来骨薄面无膏，疫气冲头鬓茎少。\n欲雕小说干天官，宗孙不调爲谁怜。\n明朝下元复西道，崆峒叙别长如天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}